CM_ BO_ 710 "Brake interlock input watched by HRR CANCTR. Panda forwards the unchanged LS600h bus 1 0x2C6 frame to bus 2 because this ID was absent from the supplied Radar bus capture. BRAKE_PRESSED is byte0 bit1. A missing or stale frame, or a fresh frame with BRAKE_PRESSED=1, sets SVEC DELTA to 0 and drives REL and RELE off; torque and relay commands are ignored until a fresh not-pressed frame arrives.";
CM_ SG_ 710 BRAKE_PRESSED "When 1 in a fresh 0x2C6 frame, HRR CANCTR disengages torque output and opens REL/RELE. Missing or stale 0x2C6 also keeps the interlock active.";

