CM_ BO_ 1588 "HRR safety and measurement state. Brake_Frame_Age is 65535 when no brake frame has been seen; Torque_Frame_Age is 65535 when no valid torque frame has been accepted. Angle_Delta is the signed shortest modulo-180 OU_Angle minus IN_Angle difference and is valid only when both angle-valid bits are set.";

BO_ 1589 HRR_AngleCalibrationStatus: 8 STM32G474_HRR
 SG_ Calibration_Running : 0|1@1+ (1,0) [0|1] "" CAN_Master
 SG_ Calibration_Valid : 1|1@1+ (1,0) [0|1] "" CAN_Master
 SG_ Calibration_Enabled : 2|1@1+ (1,0) [0|1] "" CAN_Master
 SG_ Calibration_Failed : 3|1@1+ (1,0) [0|1] "" CAN_Master
 SG_ Calibration_Params_Complete : 4|1@1+ (1,0) [0|1] "" CAN_Master
 SG_ IN_Vector_Valid : 5|1@1+ (1,0) [0|1] "" CAN_Master
 SG_ OU_Vector_Valid : 6|1@1+ (1,0) [0|1] "" CAN_Master
 SG_ Legacy_Angles_Active : 7|1@1+ (1,0) [0|1] "" CAN_Master
 SG_ Calibration_Version : 8|8@1+ (1,0) [0|255] "" CAN_Master
 SG_ Calibration_Samples : 16|16@1+ (1,0) [0|65535] "samples" CAN_Master
 SG_ Calibration_Staged_Mask : 32|16@1+ (1,0) [0|1023] "" CAN_Master
 SG_ Calibration_Failure_Reason : 48|8@1+ (1,0) [0|7] "" CAN_Master
 SG_ Calibration_RMS_Error : 56|8@1+ (0.1,0) [0|25.5] "deg" CAN_Master
CM_ BO_ 1589 "Resolver calibration protocol v2 status. Staged mask bits 0..7 correspond to commands 11..18, bit8 to command 19, and bit9 to command 20. A complete fit requires mask 0x03FF, at least 100 samples, RMS error <=1.5 degrees, and maximum error <=5.0 degrees. Failure reasons: 0 none, 1 unsafe, 2 session, 3 incomplete, 4 coefficient, 5 fit, 6 NVM, 7 timeout.";

BO_ 1590 HRR_TrueAngleStatus: 8 STM32G474_HRR
 SG_ True_Steering_Angle : 0|32@1- (0.01,0) [-21474836.48|21474836.47] "deg" CAN_Master
 SG_ True_Steering_Rate : 32|16@1- (0.1,0) [-3276.8|3276.7] "deg/s" CAN_Master
 SG_ True_Angle_Valid : 48|1@1+ (1,0) [0|1] "" CAN_Master
 SG_ True_Angle_Initialized : 49|1@1+ (1,0) [0|1] "" CAN_Master
 SG_ True_Angle_Resolver_Valid : 50|1@1+ (1,0) [0|1] "" CAN_Master
 SG_ True_Angle_Calibrated : 51|1@1+ (1,0) [0|1] "" CAN_Master
 SG_ True_Angle_Reference_Fresh : 52|1@1+ (1,0) [0|1] "" CAN_Master
 SG_ True_Angle_Wrap_Ambiguous : 53|1@1+ (1,0) [0|1] "" CAN_Master
 SG_ True_Angle_Counter : 56|8@1+ (1,0) [0|255] "" CAN_Master
CM_ BO_ 1590 "High-resolution absolute steering measurement from the CAL2-corrected IN resolver vector. Angle is valid only after a fresh, consistent 0x25 reference anchors the modulo-180 sector. Invalid gap, delta, or derived rate clears initialization; a fresh reference permits automatic re-anchoring. Legacy or disabled calibration never sets True_Angle_Valid.";

BO_ 1591 HRR_ResolverVectorStatus: 8 STM32G474_HRR
 SG_ IN_Cos_RMS : 0|16@1- (1,0) [-32768|32767] "code_rms" CAN_Master
 SG_ IN_Sin_Signed_RMS : 16|16@1- (1,0) [-32768|32767] "code_rms" CAN_Master
