 SG_ OU_Sin_Signed_RMS : 48|16@1- (1,0) [-32768|32767] "code_rms" CAN_Master
CM_ BO_ 1591 "Uncalibrated signed RMS/covariance vectors used before atan2. Cos RMS is nonnegative; the sine RMS sign is selected from centered sine/cosine covariance. Host calibration fits 2x2 Q20 matrices to these values.";

